WEBVTT

01:31.982 --> 01:37.300
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.300 --> 01:40.640
[Episode 28]

01:40.640 --> 01:42.439
The Chen family has fallen from power.

01:42.439 --> 01:45.200
Now, the position
of Deputy Transport Officer is vacant.

01:46.040 --> 01:47.560
His Majesty has asked me
to recommend a candidate.

01:49.000 --> 01:50.359
I'd like to ask Your Highness

01:50.359 --> 01:51.719
to advise me.

01:52.359 --> 01:53.799
If my marriage is canceled,

01:53.799 --> 01:56.560
I'm afraid the rewards will also be gone.

01:57.760 --> 02:00.239
His Majesty and you are very close.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.359
He has been hoping

02:02.359 --> 02:03.560
for a good woman

02:03.560 --> 02:05.000
to attend to you.

02:06.319 --> 02:07.599
You can't

02:07.599 --> 02:09.319
let him down.

02:11.199 --> 02:13.080
I have an idea.

02:13.080 --> 02:16.240
You can marry

02:16.240 --> 02:17.280
another good woman.

02:18.680 --> 02:20.960
When His Majesty visited my house,

02:20.960 --> 02:22.120
he saw He Weifang.

02:22.719 --> 02:24.319
And His Majesty asked He Weifang

02:24.319 --> 02:25.560
to learn dancing.

02:26.439 --> 02:27.599
Today, Consort Shu was present

02:27.599 --> 02:28.840
at the Xingqing Palace.

02:29.599 --> 02:31.000
If I change the woman I'm marrying,

02:31.560 --> 02:33.560
His Majesty will blame me for deceiving him.

02:37.639 --> 02:39.240
Your daughter

02:39.240 --> 02:40.680
wants Zishu's affection.

02:41.719 --> 02:43.039
If I marry He Weifang,

02:43.039 --> 02:44.919
it will cut off Zishu's thoughts of her.

02:44.919 --> 02:47.400
It helps your daughter solve a problem.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.400
If something happens to He Weifang,

02:50.400 --> 02:51.759
my marriage

02:51.759 --> 02:53.840
isn't the only thing to be spoiled.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.759
Your daughter got injured.

02:58.759 --> 02:59.840
It's a fact.

03:00.879 --> 03:02.520
I don't want to see her hurt.

03:03.439 --> 03:04.759
Besides,

03:04.759 --> 03:06.319
I don't want to disappoint His Majesty.

03:07.800 --> 03:10.280
What do you think, Your Highness?

03:35.039 --> 03:36.584
See you.

03:38.479 --> 03:40.520
What are you going to say to Her Highness?

03:41.039 --> 03:43.280
The injury of Youzhen is irreversible.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.599
Even if Lady He is killed,

03:44.599 --> 03:45.639
it can't change the fact.

03:46.319 --> 03:49.960
It's alright to do Mr. Jiang a favor

03:52.360 --> 03:53.919
and get some benefits.

03:57.599 --> 03:59.520
The position of Deputy Transport Officer

03:59.520 --> 04:01.360
will be her future husband's.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.760
Yes.

04:08.240 --> 04:09.608
Go.

04:18.720 --> 04:19.880
Let's go.

04:20.959 --> 04:22.959
To see my concubine I'm about to take.

04:47.639 --> 04:49.120
Taking her as a concubine

04:49.120 --> 04:50.319
is a stopgap measure.

04:51.319 --> 04:52.648
Well…

05:05.920 --> 05:07.272
He Weifang.

05:16.480 --> 05:17.960
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

05:19.800 --> 05:21.040
Everyone knows

05:21.040 --> 05:22.480
Prince Ning dotes on his daughter.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.279
But even so,

05:24.279 --> 05:26.040
he favors his own interests.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.600
But Mr. Jiang is different.

05:27.600 --> 05:28.800
To save my life,

05:28.800 --> 05:29.879
you risked yourself,

05:29.879 --> 05:31.519
taking me as a concubine.

05:31.519 --> 05:32.839
You're so righteous.

05:32.839 --> 05:34.480
I'm very grateful to you.

05:36.759 --> 05:38.600
Moreover,

05:38.600 --> 05:40.360
I won't tell anyone about this place.

05:42.720 --> 05:45.240
Marriage is a big matter
concerning a woman's reputation.

05:45.240 --> 05:47.399
Suddenly, you will be my concubine.

05:47.399 --> 05:48.840
Do you not mind?

05:49.639 --> 05:51.439
Life is bigger than reputation.

05:52.079 --> 05:53.079
Moreover,

05:53.079 --> 05:54.319
I am just getting married again.

05:54.319 --> 05:56.720
But it's your first time taking a concubine.

05:56.720 --> 05:58.000
People think you will

05:58.000 --> 05:59.680
marry a troublesome merchant,

05:59.680 --> 06:01.439
not your beloved.

06:01.439 --> 06:02.680
Anyway,

06:02.680 --> 06:03.720
it's not good for you.

06:04.480 --> 06:06.240
If I care about trifles,

06:06.240 --> 06:08.040
I'll be such a fool.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.680
You're quite optimistic.

06:15.240 --> 06:16.680
I just heard

06:17.199 --> 06:18.199
you gave Prince Ning

06:18.199 --> 06:19.519
the position of Deputy Transport Officer.

06:20.800 --> 06:22.959
You have paid a huge cost.

06:22.959 --> 06:24.480
I don't know what I can do

06:24.480 --> 06:25.720
to repay you.

06:27.600 --> 06:29.000
Don't think about it.

06:29.000 --> 06:30.000
No one knows better than me

06:30.000 --> 06:31.759
how to receive and give gifts.

06:31.759 --> 06:33.120
I have my reason

06:33.120 --> 06:34.160
to give a generous gift.

06:38.639 --> 06:39.959
Rest assured,

06:39.959 --> 06:41.240
I won't let myself be at a disadvantage.

06:44.240 --> 06:46.439
Dealing with Prince Ning is mentally
and physically taxing.

06:46.439 --> 06:47.976
I'm hungry now.

06:49.240 --> 06:51.759
Understood, then I'll grill some fish for you.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.568
Come on.

06:58.480 --> 06:59.839
I decided

06:59.839 --> 07:00.879
to marry you.

07:00.879 --> 07:02.279
As for the wedding banquet,

07:02.279 --> 07:03.839
I will do my best to prepare.

07:03.839 --> 07:05.680
You will have what a bride

07:05.680 --> 07:07.112
should have.

07:07.879 --> 07:09.839
Dowry, wedding attire and jewelry,

07:09.839 --> 07:11.360
and wedding feast,

07:11.360 --> 07:12.879
all these will be prepared as you wish.

07:13.639 --> 07:14.639
You can use whatever

07:14.639 --> 07:15.759
in my storeroom.

07:15.759 --> 07:17.439
If you want anything else,
feel free to tell me.

07:17.439 --> 07:18.728
I will--

07:19.279 --> 07:21.519
Don't hold a huge wedding.

07:21.519 --> 07:22.879
Our marriage

07:22.879 --> 07:24.759
is just a stopgap measure.

07:24.759 --> 07:26.120
If it's too eye-catching,

07:26.120 --> 07:27.480
it might give us away.

07:29.079 --> 07:31.759
I just want to give you a good wedding

07:31.759 --> 07:33.240
to make you happy.

07:33.240 --> 07:34.959
It's not the first day you've known me.

07:34.959 --> 07:36.439
If the wedding banquet

07:36.439 --> 07:38.120
affects my business,

07:38.120 --> 07:39.680
I will be unhappy.

07:43.199 --> 07:44.680
So you tell me

07:44.680 --> 07:45.959
what we should do about the wedding banquet.

07:49.079 --> 07:50.279
Let's hold a small banquet.

07:50.839 --> 07:52.120
Guests eat at the same table,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.399
sharing three pots of osmanthus wine.

07:54.079 --> 07:55.336
That's enough.

07:56.959 --> 07:58.199
As you say.

07:58.199 --> 07:59.360
Well,

07:59.360 --> 08:00.720
let's hold a low-key wedding.

08:01.360 --> 08:02.439
I object.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.920
Come on.

08:04.920 --> 08:06.120
This matter concerns Prince Ning.

08:06.879 --> 08:08.319
It's a matter of life and death.

08:08.319 --> 08:09.600
Don't leak any information

08:09.600 --> 08:10.600
and involve your friends.

08:13.680 --> 08:15.120
Mr. Jiang, you're pretty lucky

08:15.120 --> 08:16.560
to marry Mudan.

08:16.560 --> 08:17.680
If you don't

08:17.680 --> 08:18.800
give her a big wedding,

08:18.800 --> 08:20.120
I and Fu will object.

08:21.240 --> 08:22.720
It's a joyous thing.

08:22.720 --> 08:24.920
The news has already caused a stir.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.199
Tomorrow,

08:26.199 --> 08:28.279
people from all over the city
will bring gifts to celebrate.

08:28.279 --> 08:29.920
I fear they will wait in a long line to come.

08:30.680 --> 08:32.040
I think you have to

08:33.000 --> 08:34.039
hold a big wedding.

08:34.039 --> 08:35.639
No, I won't.

08:41.399 --> 08:42.759
As you know,

08:42.759 --> 08:45.080
I hate elaborate formalities.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.759
Besides, among the countless guests,

08:46.759 --> 08:48.639
how many of them are sincere to celebrate?

08:49.159 --> 08:50.879
They're just spectators,

08:50.879 --> 08:52.200
wanting to see

08:52.200 --> 08:53.559
how much Mr. Jiang

08:53.559 --> 08:54.799
loves me.

08:55.320 --> 08:56.480
When we decided to become sworn sisters,

08:56.480 --> 08:57.879
we did all the necessary rites.

08:57.879 --> 08:59.080
A wedding is a major event.

08:59.080 --> 09:00.720
How can it be hastily done?

09:00.720 --> 09:02.039
That would be too absurd.

09:02.600 --> 09:04.320
Your friends know the inside story

09:04.320 --> 09:05.480
and esteem you.

09:05.480 --> 09:06.600
But strangers

09:06.600 --> 09:08.399
only know you were a servant in the military.

09:08.399 --> 09:09.799
You do business

09:09.799 --> 09:11.679
and will marry an official.

09:13.559 --> 09:14.879
Suizhi

09:14.879 --> 09:16.480
must hold a big wedding

09:16.480 --> 09:18.159
to show his love for you.

09:18.159 --> 09:19.240
Only then can you

09:19.240 --> 09:21.360
put an end to others' gossip
about your social climbing.

09:24.799 --> 09:27.200
You mortals

09:27.200 --> 09:29.039
don't understand Mudan.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.120
This is my wedding with Mudan.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.200
Mudan decides

09:34.960 --> 09:36.000
how to hold this wedding.

09:38.039 --> 09:39.919
Mr. Jiang knows me well.

09:41.279 --> 09:43.000
I have never cared

09:43.000 --> 09:44.039
about others' gossip.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.799
I wish for a simple wedding.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.799
Our good friends

09:48.799 --> 09:50.200
come to celebrate

09:50.200 --> 09:51.519
with earnest feelings.

09:51.519 --> 09:53.080
That's bigger than betrothal presents

09:53.080 --> 09:54.248
and a grand wedding.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.679
Wait,

10:01.679 --> 10:03.799
Mudan and Suizhi are about to get married.

10:03.799 --> 10:05.639
Why did Mudan still call you Mr. Jiang?

10:10.039 --> 10:11.679
I've also mentioned this to her.

10:11.679 --> 10:12.840
But she's got used to calling me that.

10:13.399 --> 10:14.519
She forgot to change how we address each other.

10:15.840 --> 10:18.200
Mudan seems forthright,

10:18.200 --> 10:19.559
but she's bashful.

10:20.279 --> 10:21.879
It's not urgent
to change how we address each other.

10:22.480 --> 10:24.000
I need to talk to Mr. Third.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.919
I'll come back to drink

10:25.919 --> 10:27.879
with you later.

10:27.879 --> 10:29.000
Okay.

10:35.519 --> 10:36.639
Mudan.

10:36.639 --> 10:38.720
This is all too sudden.

10:38.720 --> 10:40.159
Do you truly want

10:40.159 --> 10:41.320
to be his concubine?

10:41.320 --> 10:43.840
- He isn't forcing you, is he?
- No, he isn't.

10:43.840 --> 10:45.039
Don't worry.

10:45.039 --> 10:46.399
We can't control what he did before.

10:46.919 --> 10:47.960
After the marriage,

10:47.960 --> 10:49.320
if he makes you sad,

10:49.960 --> 10:51.120
I'll beat him up.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.679
Alright.

10:54.919 --> 10:57.639
Come on, let's eat some meat.

10:57.639 --> 10:58.840
Okay, let's eat.

10:59.480 --> 11:01.200
It is undercooked.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.240
It's alright.

11:02.240 --> 11:03.360
I'm starving.

11:05.480 --> 11:07.279
Even though I won't invite guests,

11:07.279 --> 11:08.919
I still need to maintain appearances.

11:09.720 --> 11:12.600
I need help from the Bureau of Etiquette,

11:12.600 --> 11:14.600
the Bureau of Attire, and the Bureau of Food.

11:15.919 --> 11:17.799
I need to arrange the wedding ceremony.

11:18.600 --> 11:20.200
The wedding cakes

11:20.879 --> 11:22.879
will be sent to the officials
throughout the city.

11:24.720 --> 11:26.360
Do you need help from the Bureau of Beds?

11:28.200 --> 11:29.639
It's just for show.

11:29.639 --> 11:31.240
I don't need to sleep with her.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.639
But I've heard

11:34.639 --> 11:36.360
that there are specifics about the bridal bed.

11:37.200 --> 11:38.360
It's unlucky to make it wrong.

11:39.200 --> 11:40.440
So I need their help.

11:41.759 --> 11:43.679
Have you thought of names for your children?

11:44.360 --> 11:46.240
I told you. It's all fake.

11:46.240 --> 11:47.279
Don't be silly.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.639
You're the Vice Minister
of Office of Imperial Ceremonies.

11:49.639 --> 11:50.960
You've held various feasts.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.039
You look so serious

11:52.039 --> 11:53.600
about this fake marriage.

11:53.600 --> 11:56.360
Will you make it real?

11:57.519 --> 11:59.519
I'm taking a concubine.

11:59.519 --> 12:01.279
If I don't hold my wedding publicly,

12:01.279 --> 12:02.759
Prince Ning will become suspicious.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.679
Don't be a blabbermouth in front of Mudan.

12:07.639 --> 12:08.759
I don't want her to get me wrong.

12:12.639 --> 12:14.000
You came

12:14.919 --> 12:16.000
right after Prince Ning left.

12:17.519 --> 12:19.159
Perfect timing.

12:19.840 --> 12:21.416
What are you here for?

12:27.639 --> 12:30.519
I heard County Princess Ji'an fell off a horse

12:30.519 --> 12:32.080
and Lingge helped Mudan out of her predicament.

12:32.759 --> 12:34.120
That's why I came.

12:38.240 --> 12:40.399
Consort Hui angered Consort Shu.

12:40.399 --> 12:41.480
You don't know how to please her.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.720
So you want Mudan

12:42.720 --> 12:44.600
to help you, right?

12:51.519 --> 12:53.279
Your house

12:53.279 --> 12:54.679
is small and simple.

12:54.679 --> 12:56.080
However, Lady He,

12:56.080 --> 12:57.480
a capable businesswoman, lives here

12:57.480 --> 12:58.960
and never leaves.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.480
I have a fancy palace.

13:01.080 --> 13:02.480
Yet Lingge frequently moves out.

13:02.480 --> 13:03.759
I can't even get her back.

13:05.000 --> 13:08.080
You have a fake marriage with a lady you like.

13:08.080 --> 13:09.759
Meanwhile,

13:09.759 --> 13:12.080
my woman is leaving me.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.960
Don't worry.

13:13.960 --> 13:15.480
In the past,

13:15.480 --> 13:17.159
Consort Shu was lonely in the palace.

13:17.159 --> 13:18.919
From now on, Mudan will keep her company.

13:19.480 --> 13:20.840
Mudan is very clever.

13:20.840 --> 13:23.240
She will unloose the knots
that upset Consort Shu.

13:28.080 --> 13:30.120
[Youqi Pavilion]
Youzhen.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.480
Youzhen, don't be like this.

13:31.480 --> 13:33.159
Youzhen, calm down.

13:34.200 --> 13:35.440
Youzhen.

13:35.440 --> 13:36.759
Stop it.

13:47.480 --> 13:48.720
Three years ago,

13:50.279 --> 13:51.480
my marriage

13:52.960 --> 13:54.279
was exchanged for the loyalty

13:54.279 --> 13:56.080
from the prominent families.

13:58.039 --> 14:00.440
Now, my suffering

14:03.360 --> 14:06.200
has become a good deal
for you and the Floral Envoy.

14:10.600 --> 14:12.039
Right now,

14:15.200 --> 14:16.320
I can no longer

14:16.320 --> 14:17.320
do anything

14:17.320 --> 14:18.440
for you.

14:21.639 --> 14:23.600
I'd rather die than live

14:25.799 --> 14:27.799
in humiliation.

14:27.799 --> 14:29.480
Youzhen.

14:29.480 --> 14:31.840
Don't think of it.

14:33.519 --> 14:35.000
I remember

14:36.200 --> 14:37.320
what you've suffered.

14:38.159 --> 14:41.279
You will be compensated in the future.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.919
Will I have a future?

14:50.399 --> 14:53.000
Now everyone in Chang'an knows

14:53.000 --> 14:55.240
that I've been humiliated by a merchant.

14:55.240 --> 14:56.879
I can't have children.

14:59.320 --> 15:00.744
There is nothing He Weifang can do

15:04.320 --> 15:06.679
to pay for what she did to me.

15:10.840 --> 15:12.039
If I can't give birth to children,

15:13.559 --> 15:14.879
will Zishu still be willing

15:14.879 --> 15:16.320
to marry me?

15:18.759 --> 15:20.320
Even if he is,

15:22.399 --> 15:24.559
he will take concubines

15:24.559 --> 15:26.039
to have children.

15:26.559 --> 15:28.559
What should I do then?

15:32.720 --> 15:33.928
You--

15:34.799 --> 15:36.360
Your Highness.

15:36.360 --> 15:37.600
Liu Shen and his son are here.

15:38.639 --> 15:39.784
Father.

15:40.559 --> 15:42.960
I can no longer face Zishu.

15:42.960 --> 15:45.159
If he despises me for this--

15:45.960 --> 15:46.960
He won't dare.

15:49.919 --> 15:51.039
Lie down.

15:51.039 --> 15:52.392
Lie down, Youzhen.

15:55.159 --> 15:56.639
Since you two are engaged,

15:57.919 --> 15:59.320
you should share weal and woe.

16:01.399 --> 16:03.679
You've suffered a lot.

16:04.480 --> 16:06.039
As your husband,

16:07.200 --> 16:08.799
he should

16:08.799 --> 16:09.919
comfort you

16:09.919 --> 16:11.240
and be with you.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.136
Don't worry.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.920
I'm here for you.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.919
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

16:53.639 --> 16:55.279
Your Highness.

16:55.279 --> 16:56.759
This is good medicine.

16:56.759 --> 16:58.840
His Highness got this from His Majesty.

16:59.440 --> 17:00.600
Please take it.

17:05.640 --> 17:07.559
Liu Chang is not worthy of Your Highness.

17:07.559 --> 17:08.720
And he's unfaithful

17:08.720 --> 17:10.160
and ungrateful.

17:10.160 --> 17:11.799
You got hurt for him,

17:11.799 --> 17:13.519
damaging your health.

17:13.519 --> 17:15.160
I feel so sad about this.

17:16.000 --> 17:18.079
Your Highness, why must you marry him?

17:23.400 --> 17:25.279
I'm from a royal family.

17:27.559 --> 17:29.720
My father's love for me

17:34.880 --> 17:36.160
cannot outweigh his interests

17:42.119 --> 17:43.440
and power.

17:46.839 --> 17:48.759
I'm clear about this.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.720
So, I cherish Zishu.

17:54.799 --> 17:55.920
At least I don't

17:55.920 --> 17:57.519
have to calculate the gains and losses

17:59.440 --> 18:00.759
of my love

18:00.759 --> 18:02.000
for him.

18:06.519 --> 18:07.640
I'm afraid

18:09.599 --> 18:10.960
this is the only pure thing

18:15.480 --> 18:17.160
in my life.

18:26.559 --> 18:27.720
Well…

18:36.119 --> 18:37.640
Are you going to let me live with your family

18:38.680 --> 18:39.759
after marriage?

18:40.960 --> 18:42.519
Your Highness.

18:42.519 --> 18:43.960
Zishu is my only son.

18:44.559 --> 18:46.519
My family is not lowly.

18:47.079 --> 18:48.480
How can you let my son

18:48.480 --> 18:50.039
be childless?

18:50.039 --> 18:52.359
Zishu will be ridiculed.

18:55.039 --> 18:56.079
Youzhen

18:57.519 --> 18:59.279
was hurt because of your ex-wife.

19:00.599 --> 19:03.000
I fear she can't give birth to children.

19:08.359 --> 19:10.240
Zishu feels sorry

19:10.240 --> 19:11.960
for what your daughter has suffered.

19:11.960 --> 19:14.400
He will love her and care for her more.

19:14.400 --> 19:15.640
If he has a concubine-born child in the future,

19:15.640 --> 19:17.480
the child will be adopted by your daughter.

19:17.480 --> 19:20.160
Adoption

19:20.160 --> 19:21.680
is a good solution.

19:23.160 --> 19:26.079
If you wish to continue the family line

19:26.799 --> 19:28.640
your son can adopt a child

19:28.640 --> 19:30.720
from a distant relative.

19:31.440 --> 19:32.680
Isn't that quite good?

19:35.480 --> 19:36.759
Youzhen

19:36.759 --> 19:38.160
is suffering

19:38.839 --> 19:41.599
because of Zishu's unfaithfulness.

19:42.480 --> 19:44.240
If he has concubines

19:44.240 --> 19:45.480
and illegitimate children,

19:46.519 --> 19:48.519
I fear the same thing will happen again,

19:48.519 --> 19:49.720
causing big trouble.

19:55.759 --> 19:57.416
Your Highness.

19:58.279 --> 20:00.319
If Youzhen feels worried,

20:00.319 --> 20:01.880
I will explain to her

20:01.880 --> 20:03.599
to reassure her.

20:03.599 --> 20:04.880
You know Youzhen

20:04.880 --> 20:06.359
very well.

20:07.559 --> 20:08.759
This is the only way

20:08.759 --> 20:09.960
to reassure her.

20:11.039 --> 20:12.359
It's settled.

20:13.599 --> 20:15.119
I promise

20:15.119 --> 20:16.759
I will help you

20:16.759 --> 20:19.279
become a chief minister.

20:22.319 --> 20:23.359
I understand your deep love

20:23.359 --> 20:24.359
for your daughter.

20:25.359 --> 20:26.440
You care about Youzhen

20:27.119 --> 20:28.160
very much.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.200
However,

20:30.200 --> 20:31.440
it's not a small thing.

20:32.160 --> 20:33.839
I must consult with the elders in the family.

20:35.039 --> 20:36.279
I beseech Your Highness

20:36.839 --> 20:38.319
to give me some time to consider it.

20:39.279 --> 20:40.279
My father and I

20:40.279 --> 20:41.279
shall take our leave.

20:47.839 --> 20:49.256
Your Highness.

20:55.839 --> 20:57.064
Your Highness.

21:03.039 --> 21:05.160
Your Highness, please don't be mad.

21:05.160 --> 21:08.240
Considering that Youzhen loves you,

21:08.240 --> 21:10.359
I've mercifully compromised.

21:11.519 --> 21:13.000
I have said it.

21:13.000 --> 21:14.400
This is the only way.

21:14.960 --> 21:16.680
Sign the contract to marry into my family.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.799
Then you can

21:17.799 --> 21:19.160
make any request.

21:23.720 --> 21:26.200
How absurd her love is.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.720
Her suffering is immense.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.240
So you make me suffer more?

21:31.279 --> 21:32.400
She is unable to bear children.

21:33.200 --> 21:34.720
So you force me to marry into your family

21:34.720 --> 21:36.200
and end my family line?

21:36.200 --> 21:37.799
Zishu.

21:39.480 --> 21:41.359
I'm from an old and well-known family.

21:41.359 --> 21:42.839
I don't have to rely on marriage

21:42.839 --> 21:44.640
and sell myself to survive.

21:45.799 --> 21:47.640
I can marry Youzhen.

21:48.400 --> 21:50.200
But I can't marry

21:50.200 --> 21:51.400
into her family.

21:51.400 --> 21:53.160
Fine.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.200
Then the Liu family

21:54.960 --> 21:57.000
can be childless today.

21:58.240 --> 22:01.519
- Your Highness, I'll sign.
- Father.

22:01.519 --> 22:02.640
I agree

22:02.640 --> 22:03.720
on behalf of Zishu.

22:03.720 --> 22:06.319
Father.

22:06.319 --> 22:07.359
I do not agree.

22:07.359 --> 22:08.488
Step aside.

22:10.519 --> 22:13.000
[Marriage Contract]
Father.

22:15.039 --> 22:16.839
All marriages are arranged.

22:16.839 --> 22:18.319
As your father,

22:18.319 --> 22:19.799
I have the right

22:20.519 --> 22:22.480
to arrange your marriage.

22:22.480 --> 22:23.599
It's a joyous thing.

22:24.160 --> 22:26.160
Youzhen is faithful to you.

22:26.160 --> 22:28.519
You should do the same.

22:28.519 --> 22:33.599
Your Highness.

22:33.599 --> 22:34.599
Don't be mad.

22:38.799 --> 22:40.359
Well,

22:41.119 --> 22:42.400
very clever of you.

22:44.839 --> 22:46.319
Send him out.

22:46.319 --> 22:47.720
Yes.

22:52.920 --> 22:55.000
Your Highness, Zishu…

22:56.880 --> 22:59.279
Zishu is stubborn by nature.

23:00.279 --> 23:01.960
I will try to persuade him again.

23:44.079 --> 23:45.480
I know

23:45.480 --> 23:46.759
you're powerful.

23:48.279 --> 23:50.160
But even if you trap me in the bridal chamber,

23:50.720 --> 23:53.440
will you tie me to Youzhen for a lifetime?

24:03.200 --> 24:04.359
Zishu,

24:06.559 --> 24:07.799
you think

24:08.319 --> 24:09.440
it's unfair for you

24:09.440 --> 24:11.200
to marry into my family

24:11.200 --> 24:13.119
and will be childless, right?

24:16.039 --> 24:17.920
Fine.

24:17.920 --> 24:19.240
Then I will

24:19.240 --> 24:20.960
do you a favor.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.319
In this way,

24:24.319 --> 24:26.119
you will be willing

24:26.119 --> 24:27.200
to marry Youzhen

24:27.920 --> 24:29.480
and live in harmony.

24:30.039 --> 24:31.048
Someone.

24:32.119 --> 24:33.759
Prepare

24:33.759 --> 24:35.119
a pair of good walking sticks

24:36.559 --> 24:37.720
for Zishu.

24:37.720 --> 24:39.016
Yes.

24:56.799 --> 24:57.960
You

24:58.480 --> 25:00.680
just think too highly of yourself.

25:02.279 --> 25:03.640
Arrogance

25:03.640 --> 25:05.160
and determination

25:05.160 --> 25:06.799
are meant to be tempered.

25:08.319 --> 25:09.559
Figure it out sooner.

25:10.400 --> 25:12.119
Don't keep Youzhen waiting too long.

25:23.359 --> 25:24.559
Chun.

25:24.559 --> 25:26.400
Fu.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.200
As Mudan's good friends,

25:28.200 --> 25:30.039
you want to test me for Mudan.

25:30.039 --> 25:31.079
I understand.

25:31.079 --> 25:32.599
I have said it.

25:32.599 --> 25:34.039
I have no wife

25:34.039 --> 25:35.319
or kept woman.

25:35.319 --> 25:37.319
I never like any dancing girls.

25:37.319 --> 25:39.000
Those women are merely

25:39.000 --> 25:41.200
in an employer-employee relationship with me.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.504
Crap!

25:44.680 --> 25:46.248
Fu.

25:50.799 --> 25:52.359
Nonsense.

25:52.359 --> 25:54.119
You said before

25:54.119 --> 25:55.960
that you and Mudan were
in an employer-employee relationship.

25:56.960 --> 25:58.119
Did I ever say that?

25:59.880 --> 26:00.960
I fell in love with Mudan

26:00.960 --> 26:02.200
at first sight.

26:03.359 --> 26:04.400
I do business with her

26:05.240 --> 26:06.519
to express my love for her.

26:10.000 --> 26:11.368
Sure.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.400
That's true.

26:15.119 --> 26:17.119
Gradually, we started

26:18.440 --> 26:19.839
to love each other.

26:20.839 --> 26:21.839
Anyway, Mr. Jiang

26:21.839 --> 26:23.440
is not a lecher.

26:23.440 --> 26:25.119
And Chun has already

26:25.119 --> 26:26.160
taken his pulse?

26:28.240 --> 26:30.240
He is in good health.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.880
Very good.

26:32.759 --> 26:33.832
However…

26:35.480 --> 26:36.776
Go on.

26:36.776 --> 26:37.920
You say it.

26:38.440 --> 26:41.039
- You frequented dance houses.
- With women around you.

26:41.039 --> 26:42.160
Could it be just

26:42.160 --> 26:43.200
drinking and chatting?

26:44.440 --> 26:46.759
Your thoughts are so sordid.

26:46.759 --> 26:48.680
I flattered those dancers and musicians
against my will

26:48.680 --> 26:49.920
for Mudan's business

26:49.920 --> 26:51.279
to get better.

26:51.279 --> 26:52.400
Otherwise, could you

26:52.400 --> 26:54.000
get many orders?

26:54.759 --> 26:56.000
Yes, indeed.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.319
Lady He

26:57.319 --> 26:59.480
wants a simple wedding.

26:59.480 --> 27:02.319
But Mr. Jiang risked being impeached

27:02.319 --> 27:04.079
and invited female officials to help.

27:04.640 --> 27:05.640
It's all done according to the rituals

27:05.640 --> 27:07.319
of marrying a wife.

27:08.039 --> 27:09.400
I swear

27:10.119 --> 27:11.960
I'm sincere to Mudan.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.039
However, Mudan doesn't

27:13.039 --> 27:14.039
change her mind.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.799
Yeah.

27:19.799 --> 27:21.440
Previously,

27:21.440 --> 27:23.039
I dared not believe in your sincerity.

27:23.720 --> 27:26.200
Now that Chun has taken your pulse,

27:26.200 --> 27:27.759
I am clear about it now.

27:28.920 --> 27:31.599
I'm lucky to marry you.

27:36.759 --> 27:40.000
But look at you two.

27:40.599 --> 27:41.960
You don't

27:41.960 --> 27:43.839
look intimate at all.

27:47.319 --> 27:48.400
Mudan

27:48.400 --> 27:50.480
put her mind on business before.

27:50.480 --> 27:52.160
And I never loved any woman.

27:52.160 --> 27:54.160
Now this is my first relationship.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.759
I'm unfamiliar with it.

28:01.640 --> 28:04.279
However, the two of you
have never been in love, right?

28:04.839 --> 28:07.039
It's normal that you can't tell the affection

28:07.039 --> 28:08.119
between me and Mudan.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.279
Well…

28:24.160 --> 28:25.559
Look,

28:25.559 --> 28:26.839
Mudan can't help smiling

28:26.839 --> 28:28.119
for marrying a man like me.

28:28.880 --> 28:30.079
In front of your friends,

28:30.799 --> 28:32.119
no need to hold back.

28:32.119 --> 28:33.672
Just laugh if you want to.

28:37.640 --> 28:39.039
Yes, look,

28:39.039 --> 28:41.519
you're showing the affection

28:41.519 --> 28:43.240
between lovers

28:43.240 --> 28:44.599
as the book says.

28:45.200 --> 28:46.400
Affection.

28:46.400 --> 28:48.104
Yes, affection.

28:49.039 --> 28:50.359
So, tell us.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.119
Before,

28:52.119 --> 28:53.319
how did you two fall in love

28:53.319 --> 28:54.759
and flirt

28:55.759 --> 28:57.680
right under our noses?

29:09.319 --> 29:11.720
He brought back the Hu cakes

29:11.720 --> 29:12.920
my father made

29:12.920 --> 29:14.200
from Luoyang.

29:16.119 --> 29:17.279
They were delicious.

29:18.440 --> 29:20.079
Tasty?

29:20.079 --> 29:21.672
What about you?

29:23.759 --> 29:25.119
I had feelings for Mudan

29:25.119 --> 29:26.519
when I saw her in Liu Mansion

29:27.599 --> 29:28.599
in Luoyang.

29:29.640 --> 29:31.759
Back then, she was still married.

29:31.759 --> 29:34.480
So I had to hide my feelings.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.720
I'm surprised to hear that.

29:38.279 --> 29:39.920
It does make sense.

29:39.920 --> 29:41.759
What about after you met again in Chang'an?

29:43.480 --> 29:44.880
- She went up the mountain--
- He was--

29:47.599 --> 29:49.920
He was forced by the powerful to get married.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.039
I helped him out.

29:52.519 --> 29:54.559
She went up the mountain to pick flowers
and encountered a fierce tiger.

29:54.559 --> 29:56.319
Fortunately, I saved her.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.680
So, you helped him, or he helped you?

30:01.119 --> 30:02.319
We helped each other.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.319
A bad official and a bad merchant

30:05.319 --> 30:06.599
are a perfect match.

30:06.599 --> 30:08.160
I lent her money to do business.

30:08.799 --> 30:10.079
It happened

30:10.079 --> 30:11.519
that we became neighbors.

30:11.519 --> 30:12.968
As time went by,

30:13.640 --> 30:14.960
we fell in love.

30:16.392 --> 30:18.240
♫ If love is like frost ♫

30:18.240 --> 30:19.880
We drank and chatted

30:19.880 --> 30:21.200
every night.

30:21.200 --> 30:23.440
Gradually,

30:23.960 --> 30:25.880
we were in love.

30:27.519 --> 30:29.079
So, finally,

30:29.079 --> 30:30.480
we're together.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.799
Do you have any more questions?

30:32.319 --> 30:35.559
No more questions.

30:35.559 --> 30:36.759
Lady He.

30:36.759 --> 30:38.960
My master has received your introduction.

30:38.960 --> 30:40.720
I'm here to escort you.

30:40.720 --> 30:42.000
Coming right away.

30:43.160 --> 30:45.279
Look, it's the same as the book says.

30:48.880 --> 30:50.312
Let me help.

30:54.640 --> 30:55.640
You do your things.

30:55.640 --> 30:57.480
I'll be waiting for you to have dinner at home.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.799
I'll go see Mudan out.

31:00.799 --> 31:02.216
Make yourselves comfortable.

31:09.192 --> 31:10.480
Alright.

31:10.480 --> 31:11.759
Mudan has Mr. Jiang.

31:11.759 --> 31:13.480
I'll go back to have dinner with my mother.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.359
Mudan just

31:17.359 --> 31:18.400
packed up so many things.

31:18.400 --> 31:19.688
Where is she going?

31:20.400 --> 31:21.519
The one who saved Mudan at the horse field

31:21.519 --> 31:23.519
is not in good health

31:23.519 --> 31:25.440
and can't take strong medicine.

31:25.440 --> 31:27.640
We have studied the prescriptions
she normally uses.

31:27.640 --> 31:29.319
The cause of the illness
is postpartum depression

31:29.319 --> 31:30.720
and lack of sleep.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.359
So we developed

31:32.359 --> 31:33.839
some nourishing bath beans

31:33.839 --> 31:34.839
and aromatic incense,

31:34.839 --> 31:36.960
hoping to make her feel better.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.640
Alright, you treat the patient.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.640
I'm going back home.

31:42.279 --> 31:43.519
Go inform Mr. Third

31:43.519 --> 31:44.839
to immediately rush to Xingqing Palace.

31:45.599 --> 31:47.759
If Mudan makes his woman happy,

31:47.759 --> 31:49.240
he should thank me.

31:49.240 --> 31:50.599
Yes.

31:50.599 --> 31:52.839
My lord, you want
to send a betrothal gift to Lady He,

31:52.839 --> 31:54.519
but you fear she won't accept it, right?

31:54.519 --> 31:55.720
I got a message from Fu.

31:55.720 --> 31:57.319
It's about something she must accept.

31:57.319 --> 31:58.519
How would you like to thank me?

32:02.079 --> 32:03.720
What Lady He longs for

32:03.720 --> 32:05.759
is definitely not gold, silver, or jewels

32:05.759 --> 32:07.559
but the garden her mother liked,

32:07.559 --> 32:09.160
Fragrance Garden.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.160
A few days ago,

32:10.160 --> 32:11.160
Fragrance Garden was for sale.

32:11.160 --> 32:12.519
Lady He borrowed money from the pawnshop,

32:12.519 --> 32:13.880
wanting to buy it.

32:13.880 --> 32:15.160
Unexpectedly,

32:15.160 --> 32:16.200
Lv Wanrong bought it first.

32:18.279 --> 32:19.599
She earns money through business.

32:20.720 --> 32:22.640
Yet she never spends on herself.

32:23.960 --> 32:25.440
Turns out she saves money to buy the garden.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.519
You can

32:28.519 --> 32:30.160
afford that garden.

32:30.160 --> 32:31.640
Let's pay a visit to Lv Wanrong.

32:31.640 --> 32:33.440
I suppose he won't refuse to sell it to you.

32:34.759 --> 32:36.400
Mudan has her pride.

32:36.400 --> 32:37.960
She must want
to buy the Fragrance Garden on her own.

32:38.920 --> 32:40.319
If I buy it for her,

32:40.319 --> 32:41.640
it will hurt her pride.

32:42.319 --> 32:43.359
She will think

32:43.359 --> 32:44.759
her efforts are all in vain.

32:45.920 --> 32:47.480
Moreover,

32:47.480 --> 32:48.960
Lv Wanrong is her friend's father.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.440
He bought it legitimately.

32:50.440 --> 32:52.400
If I force him to sell it to me,

32:53.200 --> 32:55.240
I'll be blamed by Mudan.

32:55.240 --> 32:56.839
A man and woman in love

32:56.839 --> 32:58.079
should help

32:58.079 --> 32:59.440
and think of each other.

33:00.359 --> 33:02.480
Since when have you become a love expert?

33:03.480 --> 33:05.079
I've never seen you with a woman.

33:08.839 --> 33:10.319
I'm going to see Mr. Third.

33:32.680 --> 33:35.319
I like riding and shooting.

33:35.839 --> 33:37.559
Yet I'm not interested

33:37.559 --> 33:38.839
in delicate things.

33:39.559 --> 33:41.480
Unexpectedly,

33:41.480 --> 33:43.160
your incense smells so good.

33:44.759 --> 33:46.240
Smelling good is not the point.

33:46.799 --> 33:49.599
The point is, it's specially made for you.

33:50.279 --> 33:52.240
You breathe its fragrance into your lungs

33:52.240 --> 33:53.736
to cure your illness.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.680
The incense used during the day

33:56.680 --> 33:57.960
contains dried chrysanthemums

33:57.960 --> 34:00.039
purple sandalwood, and peony bark,

34:00.039 --> 34:01.319
which can soothe the liver
and relieve depression.

34:01.960 --> 34:04.160
And the incense used at night contains clove,

34:04.160 --> 34:05.960
poria, and amber,

34:05.960 --> 34:07.440
which can soothe the nerves
and get better sleep.

34:08.640 --> 34:09.880
What a clever thought.

34:10.519 --> 34:12.639
They're much better

34:12.639 --> 34:14.120
than the herbal medicine.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.280
You've lost sleep

34:16.280 --> 34:17.920
for a while.

34:17.920 --> 34:20.280
Your stomach has a problem.

34:20.280 --> 34:22.280
So, you can't take any herbal medicine.

34:23.119 --> 34:24.480
The nourished food

34:24.480 --> 34:25.599
medicinal incense,

34:25.599 --> 34:27.639
and the things used in daily life can help.

34:27.639 --> 34:29.760
Gradually, through the mild conditioning,

34:29.760 --> 34:30.840
it will work better

34:30.840 --> 34:32.039
than the herbal medicine.

34:34.320 --> 34:35.624
Your--

34:37.639 --> 34:38.824
Get out of here.

34:43.079 --> 34:44.480
Mudan is smart.

34:45.559 --> 34:46.679
You ask her

34:46.679 --> 34:48.559
to develop more suitable stuff for Lingge.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.840
Send it to me.

34:51.840 --> 34:54.320
I will personally give it to Lingge.

34:55.719 --> 34:57.159
If Lingge gets happy,

34:57.679 --> 34:58.920
she will return to the palace with me.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.920
As long as Your Majesty pays well,

35:01.920 --> 35:03.000
no matter how many you want,

35:03.000 --> 35:04.880
Mudan will make them for you.

35:05.599 --> 35:08.800
No offense, but I have something to say.

35:10.000 --> 35:12.719
You have mental knots.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.920
I tried to give birth to my child.

35:18.519 --> 35:19.960
I wish I could be with him day and night.

35:21.000 --> 35:22.239
But I must follow the rules

35:22.239 --> 35:23.679
and let the maids take care of him.

35:24.719 --> 35:25.960
I rarely see him.

35:26.559 --> 35:29.079
And I'm always judged harshly.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.920
You may inform His Majesty of this.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.280
Perhaps His Majesty

35:35.280 --> 35:36.880
will allow you to live with your child

35:37.440 --> 35:39.679
and personally raise your child.

35:41.159 --> 35:42.559
Though I'm Consort Shu,

35:43.320 --> 35:44.599
I am also his subject.

35:46.119 --> 35:48.559
His Majesty has other women.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.960
I don't think he cares for me.

35:52.199 --> 35:53.840
He won't disregard the rules

35:53.840 --> 35:54.880
for me.

35:58.920 --> 36:00.199
Life's short.

36:00.800 --> 36:03.280
What matters to you is your health

36:03.280 --> 36:04.639
and living happily.

36:05.920 --> 36:07.880
Since His Majesty has another woman,

36:08.480 --> 36:09.840
you should love yourself even more.

36:10.599 --> 36:12.400
Do not pin hopes on the heartless man.

36:12.400 --> 36:14.760
Perhaps you'll feel happy.

36:17.360 --> 36:19.000
What is she talking about?

36:19.000 --> 36:20.360
She is stirring things up.

36:21.199 --> 36:23.159
You often go to Consort Hui's palace.

36:23.159 --> 36:24.880
It is indeed a fact.

36:24.880 --> 36:26.159
Jiang Changyang.

36:26.159 --> 36:27.400
Prince Ning placed Consort Hui in the palace.

36:27.400 --> 36:28.776
Can I not go?

36:29.920 --> 36:32.079
I hoped she could
untangle Lingge's mental knots.

36:32.079 --> 36:35.000
But what did she do? She persuaded Lingge
to give up on me.

36:35.880 --> 36:37.079
It's a mental knot.

36:37.079 --> 36:38.880
She must find the source.

36:39.559 --> 36:41.480
You're already so protective of her.

36:42.639 --> 36:43.719
What about me?

36:45.840 --> 36:47.199
Since I became a Consort,

36:47.199 --> 36:49.039
no one has ever said something like this to me.

36:50.039 --> 36:51.559
They only care about

36:51.559 --> 36:54.039
whether I've managed the harem well

36:54.960 --> 36:56.559
and whether my son

36:56.559 --> 36:58.159
is smart and sensible.

36:59.360 --> 37:00.960
No one has ever asked

37:02.039 --> 37:03.800
what Huangfu Lingge truly wants.

37:07.519 --> 37:09.079
So, what do you want?

37:15.199 --> 37:16.760
Since I entered this palace,

37:18.360 --> 37:19.400
I can't

37:20.039 --> 37:21.480
hope for what I want.

37:23.159 --> 37:24.599
Perhaps,

37:25.519 --> 37:28.639
it's the safest to love myself.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.440
That's right.

37:34.159 --> 37:35.679
Let go of your knots,

37:36.239 --> 37:37.239
and your illness

37:37.239 --> 37:38.480
will be cured sooner or later.

37:39.440 --> 37:42.360
In Xingqing Palace,

37:42.360 --> 37:44.440
you might as well live more freely.

37:44.440 --> 37:46.159
Just curse when you're angry.

37:46.159 --> 37:47.280
Cry when you're sad.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.960
Seek joy when you're bored.

37:49.960 --> 37:51.480
Feel free to chat

37:51.480 --> 37:52.679
with me.

38:00.719 --> 38:02.480
But I eventually have to go back.

38:03.400 --> 38:04.519
I have to face those

38:04.519 --> 38:05.760
I don't want to face,

38:06.559 --> 38:08.920
listen to those hypocritical words,

38:09.800 --> 38:11.199
and force a smile

38:11.199 --> 38:12.960
to show my dignity and virtue.

38:15.800 --> 38:16.840
Mr. Third.

38:17.480 --> 38:19.159
Don't get the wrong idea.

38:23.039 --> 38:24.800
No need to tell Lingge that I've come.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.599
Let Mudan

38:27.599 --> 38:28.679
keep Lingge company.

39:02.400 --> 39:04.880
Mr. Liu, time to eat.

39:06.239 --> 39:07.480
I don't want to eat.

39:09.199 --> 39:10.559
I'll starve myself to death,

39:12.119 --> 39:14.039
to repay the County Princess.

39:15.679 --> 39:16.960
I would trouble you

39:16.960 --> 39:18.360
to convey a message to my parents.

39:19.920 --> 39:21.400
I'm incapable of revitalizing the family.

39:22.280 --> 39:23.800
And I am not a good son.

39:25.440 --> 39:28.239
I hope they will not be sad.

39:29.079 --> 39:30.440
Guess what? Your parents

39:30.440 --> 39:31.920
are overjoyed today.

39:31.920 --> 39:33.480
They've gratefully

39:33.480 --> 39:35.519
accepted the betrothal gifts from His Highness.

39:35.519 --> 39:36.800
They said

39:36.800 --> 39:38.639
you must stay,

39:38.639 --> 39:40.639
alive or dead.

39:42.159 --> 39:44.360
Your broken leg

39:44.360 --> 39:46.840
has been exchanged for a huge fortune.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.800
They are happy about that.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.864
Get out!

39:56.880 --> 39:59.199
If you wish to die,

39:59.880 --> 40:01.320
well,

40:01.320 --> 40:03.280
how about you

40:03.840 --> 40:05.159
eat a wedding pastry first?

40:05.960 --> 40:07.519
Get out of here.

40:08.360 --> 40:10.280
I won't marry Prince Ning's daughter.

40:10.280 --> 40:11.400
Leave these wedding pastries

40:11.400 --> 40:13.400
to His Highness.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.679
You got the wrong idea.

40:15.280 --> 40:17.760
These pastries are
from your ex-wife, He Weifang.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.840
She's marrying the Floral Envoy.

40:20.519 --> 40:21.920
His Highness said

40:21.920 --> 40:23.519
you would have an appetite

40:23.519 --> 40:24.880
upon seeing these pastries.

40:27.239 --> 40:28.520
Impossible.

40:29.400 --> 40:31.656
Impossible.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.920
Impossible.

40:33.920 --> 40:36.159
Those of high and low status
must not intermarry.

40:36.159 --> 40:37.920
Just a word from the Floral Envoy

40:37.920 --> 40:39.760
can change her household registration.

40:42.639 --> 40:44.679
The County Princess was injured
because of your ex.

40:44.679 --> 40:47.079
Your ex should have been cut into pieces.

40:47.079 --> 40:48.480
Unexpectedly,

40:48.480 --> 40:50.559
she gains the favor of Mr. Jiang.

40:50.559 --> 40:53.559
So His Highness spared her life
for the time being.

40:54.559 --> 40:57.039
You haven't forgotten your ex, have you?

40:57.599 --> 40:59.559
But look at your current state.

41:00.199 --> 41:01.360
You're no match

41:01.880 --> 41:03.679
for Jiang Changyang.

41:18.760 --> 41:20.079
Life matters.

41:20.599 --> 41:21.679
So what if your ex becomes a concubine?

41:22.320 --> 41:24.239
So what if you marry into a new wife's family?

41:25.760 --> 41:29.320
Anyway, we're living in a world

41:30.159 --> 41:31.639
where only the strong survive.

41:57.742 --> 42:04.016
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:05.870 --> 42:12.554
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:13.230 --> 42:20.428
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:21.422 --> 42:29.774
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:29.774 --> 42:37.317
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:37.971 --> 42:46.158
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:46.158 --> 42:53.969
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:54.574 --> 43:01.866
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:22.542 --> 43:29.425
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:30.726 --> 43:37.420
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:38.177 --> 43:45.479
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:46.163 --> 43:54.472
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:54.472 --> 44:01.903
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:02.734 --> 44:10.990
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:10.990 --> 44:18.414
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:19.418 --> 44:26.868
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
